{"v":4,"catch":"話是徒勞的！ 消滅鋼鐵惡魔！","desc":"UPL在1992年發行了射擊遊戲“ KOUTETSU YOUSAI STRAHL”。\n狂熱的科學家“ Gegeben Funkerun”因統治世界而形成了秘密社會“ Aizerun Geist”。\n選擇主要武器，副武器和炸彈，並用它們摧毀鋼鐵堡壘KOUTETSU YOUSAI STRAHL！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-07-22","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4b5da55761c8c64e24e1618ae136edaef45ca99094cc1851d3d1169be2e7ba0e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9c8380da0f2723910a4bc03572341fd729213a40af91c16255be15d34eda6a0b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9efebc8deb22affdcf56d9fbe54a452e8dae2fe69afe0bf459d3fda6c19d7ce5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e9c8647bce5317018b0759b3a6d3abd33760f56b7523421081fcd16f3cf5bce3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/10739d965c321f8335fb66c601f120d8f3c4bb10cce97fb4e18530ffbe784751.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7395c1d0fc6b675da8ff924bb73dec872a633fd8ade3d0be8c247ef5cd6876b3.jpg"],"titleId":"01005370123d0000","dlc":[]}